  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a medium saucepan, bring 2 cups of water to a boil.",
    "Add the French lentils to the saucepan and reduce the heat to low.",
    "Simmer the lentils for 20 minutes, or until they are tender.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the score-fat over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion to the skillet and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger to the skillet and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the chopped basil and cilantro, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cooked lentils, lime juice, salt, and black pepper to the skillet, and stir to combine.",
    "Spoon the lentil mixture onto a cedar plank and serve hot."
  ],
